  "concept": {
    "zh": "CPU 节拍和巡逻窗口",
    "en": "CPU ticks and patrol windows"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "取到两块启机板，到出口并让 CPU 停机。在任意安全格可单步执行。地址 3 要留下地址 0、1、2 三个初始读数之和。走路、拾取和 CPU 单步都会推动巡逻机。 限 36 回合；避开巡逻。工单列出巡线及目标坐标。复测时图纸旋转半圈，compass 给出图纸方向在现场对应的方向。",
    "en": "Recover both starter boards, take the exit and halt the CPU. Single-step on any safe tile. Address 3 must contain the sum of the original readings at 0, 1 and 2. Moves, pickups and CPU steps all advance the patrols. You have 36 turns. Avoid patrols. The work order lists patrol cycles and target coordinates. The second installation is rotated 180 degrees; compass maps plan directions to physical directions."
  },
